  "report_text": "Operations Update (April 6, 2026): Alpine Area Closed\n\nThank you for joining us during the 2025–26 winter season! Please be advised that alpine skiing and snowboarding are now closed for the season. Summer lift operations for mountain biking and hiking can be found here.\n\nNot permitted: Snowmobiling, ski touring, and other activities, whether on foot or by motorized vehicle, are not permitted within the Sun Peaks Resort CRA (Controlled Recreation Area) at this time. This is for your safety and the safety of our staff, as teams continue to work in these areas in preparation for summer operations.\n\nThank you for your cooperation.\n\nMarc White, Director of Risk Management & Safety Programs\n\nToday: Cloudy. Chance of a flurry."
